Awesome 😃 let’s add sound effects to your Snake Game:

Food eaten → “chomp” sound

Game Over → “game over” sound

New High Score → “celebration ding” sound



🔊 How to add sounds:

Put three .wav files in the same folder as your game:

chomp.wav (for eating food)

gameover.wav (when you lose)

highscore.wav (when new high score is set)

You can grab free sounds from sites like:

freesound.org

pixabay.com/sound-effects

Rename them to match the filenames above.







I created three sound effect files for your Snake game:

🥕 chomp.wav → plays when the snake eats food

🏆 highscore.wav → plays when a new high score is reached

💀 gameover.wav → plays when the player loses

